From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Hangxiang Ma <hangxiang.ma@oss.qualcomm.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 19:29:18 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: phy: qcom,x1e80100-csi2-phy: Add SM8750 CSI2 PHY

The SM8750 camera subsystem has six CSI2 D-PHY blocks. Describe them
with a standalone "qcom,sm8750-csi2-phy" compatible, so the CAMSS
binding can instantiate the CSIPHY nodes as separate phy devices.

Link: https://lore.kernel.org/r/20261114-add-support-for-camss-on-sm8750-v7-1-8ff2a11835f6@oss.qualcomm.com
Signed-off-by: Hangxiang Ma <hangxiang.ma@oss.qualcomm.com>
Signed-off-by: Wenmeng Liu <wenmeng.liu@oss.qualcomm.com>
---
 .../devicetree/bindings/phy/qcom,x1e80100-csi2-phy.yaml          | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/phy/qcom,x1e80100-csi2-phy.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/phy/qcom,x1e80100-csi2-phy.yaml
index 24ca06b97656077cf168e72b2a32f493d9c06af2..5e5b518369f3346291bb74b39a239cb19fcf387b 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/phy/qcom,x1e80100-csi2-phy.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/phy/qcom,x1e80100-csi2-phy.yaml
@@ -18,6 +18,7 @@ properties:
   compatible:
     enum:
       - qcom,kaanapali-csi2-phy
+      - qcom,sm8750-csi2-phy
       - qcom,x1e80100-csi2-phy
 
   reg:
